                    "line": 927,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "These checks should be done in `getCPEREntryCollectionGet`. The validated strings / string_views can than be passed down to this function & `populateCPERLogEntry`.\n\nI.e: https://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/b84653e71c342f965da5a631b8d2a4766a1606a7/redfish-core/include/utils/eventlog_utils.hpp#L573"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/utils/eventlog_utils.hpp",
                    "line": 927,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Brad Bishop",
                        "email": "bradleyb@fuzziesquirrel.com",
                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "nice, will do."
                },
