                    },
                    "message": "Actually I can't:\n\n`structured bindings with attributed identifiers only available with '-std=c++2c' or '-std=gnu++2c' [-Werror=c++26-extensions]`"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/utils/eventlog_utils.hpp",
