                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "How many CPER entries can we have ?\n\nWe this problem elsewhere but it does suck to just populate the collection we pull all the data across D-Bus...\n\nA \"GetCPERsIDs\" that just returns the IDs.. That said we have this problem elsewhere."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/include/utils/eventlog_utils.hpp",
                    "line": 969,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Brad Bishop",
                        "email": "bradleyb@fuzziesquirrel.com",
                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "There really isn't a limit on the number of entries.\n\nYeah I just followed the same patterns that exist elsewhere because I thought that was the preference.  I'm happy to add more interfaces to the dbus service if that makes things better."
                },
